<h2 class="blog_heading">
Most popular Medi Facials-Choose for yourself!
</h2>
<p>
Here are some of the most popular medi-facials. Each of these types of facial treatments is medically optimized to promote healing and a youthful appearance.<br></p>
<p><b>Hydrafacials</b> cleanses, exfoliates, extracts, and hydrates in one treatment. It uncovers a new layer of skin with gentle exfoliation and relaxing resurfacing. Also, it removes debris from pores using a vacuum-like tip to cleanse deeper. This unique, high-performance treatment will quickly help restore the skin’s balance; helps improve the appearance of several skin concerns, improve softness and texture.<br></p>
<p><b>Diamond facial or Diamond Dermabrasion</b> uses a suction- and crystal-free tip to exfoliate the outer layers of your skin in a painless manner. The treatment exfoliates and gently removes layers of dead skin cells, resulting in immediate pore size reduction and smooth skin texture using a powerful diamond tip medical-grade device. This is done to improve your skin’s texture and overall appearance.<br></p>
<p><b>Carbon peel facial</b> is an advanced skincare treatment utilizing nothing more than carbon and a laser. It is also known as charcoal facial. This is a two-stage process; the first stage involves applying a layer of liquid carbon over the face. It is followed by laser treatment for creating controlled thermal damage and stimulating the healing process. This high energy treatment goes straight to the acne’s membrane and eradicates any acne that you have before the procedure. The carbon laser peels also stimulate the growth of collagen responsible for skin regeneration, thus giving us youthful and glowing skin.<br></p>
<p><b>Microdermabrasion or micro derma peel facial</b> is a physical exfoliation which means that it is manually removing dead cells from the surface of the skin. Several types of microdermabrasion treatments are available, including crystal microdermabrasion and diamond microdermabrasion. The treatment is preferred for getting more even tone, brighter and smoother complexion.<br></p>
<p><b>Oxygen facial</b> is the most popular facial among celebrities and we will discuss this in detail in later part of the blog.<br>
</p>
<h2 class="blog_heading">What is an Oxygen Facial and How can it Benefit my skin?</h2>
<p>
This treatment is designed to nourish your skin and promote collagen growth. Firstly, the infusion of your choice is first sprayed on your skin and using a specific device. This device is equipped for spraying highly concentrated molecules of oxygen right into your epidermis. In the next step, the skin is massaged using hydrating gel to bind in moisture. The technique helps to nourish skin and promotes collagen growth.<br></p>
<p>These types of facials particularly began to gain popularity when pop singer Madonna flaunted the skincare service. Now let’s understand how this treatment transforms your skin. When pressurized, the oxygen helps the skin to absorb the serums and pushes the ingredients into deeper levels of the skin. The oxygen absorbs the moisturizing agents into the skin for a smoother, plumper look, providing a healthy glow and also strengthens the skin's elasticity. The whole treatment lasts anywhere from 30-60 minutes.<br></p>
<p>Effects of oxygen facials are said to last about two days; for best results treatment said to indulge in prior to a big event and it can be performed on all skin types. It is recommended to opt for a series of six treatments along with a six-week timeframe.<br>
</p>

<h2 class="blog_heading">What to expect when going for an Oxygen Facial Treatment?</h2>
<p>
As oxygen facials are quite different from your regular facial and here’s what you should expect from your first session.
<br></p>
<p>Your stylist will study your skin condition and select the best treatment (a type of serum) as per your needs. The first step is deep cleansing and exfoliation of your skin to get rid of dirt or bacteria. A serum containing hyaluronic acid, minerals, vitamins, and loads of antioxidants is then blasted into the skin. Now using light device pure oxygen is infused into your skin. This oxygen therapy is incredibly soothing for the skin.<br></p>
<p>The entire treatment can take from 30 to 60 minutes and is painless. The treatment is suitable for anyone and especially for those who suffer from rosacea, acne or other skin conditions. With minimum or no side effect, this incredible treatment gives you visibly clearer, plumper and smoother skin instantly.<br>
</p>
